@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true
title 07 tts narration
actor Student
participant DetailPage
participant NarrationAPI
participant Viettel
Student -> DetailPage: press listen
DetailPage -> NarrationAPI: POST /api/tts/events/{eventId}/audio
NarrationAPI -> Viettel: synthesize (token configured)
Viettel --> NarrationAPI: audio
NarrationAPI --> DetailPage: audio URL/stream
@enduml
